---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Header from '../components/Header.astro'
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - Ocean Dating App"
  description="Read Ocean’s privacy policy to understand how we collect, use, and protect your information."
>
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>How Ocean collects, uses, and protects your information</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
          <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; opacity: 0.8;">
            Last updated: December 2025
          </p>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              Crystal Dating, Inc. (“Crystal Dating,” “Ocean,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) operates
              the Ocean mobile application (the “App”). This Privacy Policy explains how we
              collect, use, disclose, and protect information about you when you use the App.
            </p>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              By using the App, you agree to the collection and use of information as described
              in this Privacy Policy.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">1. Information We Collect</h2>

            <h3 style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Information You Provide</h3>
            <ul style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              <li>Phone number (required)</li>
              <li>Email address (optional)</li>
              <li>Name (not required to be your legal name)</li>
              <li>Date of birth (used for age verification only)</li>
              <li>Gender</li>
              <li>Dating preferences (such as preferred gender)</li>
              <li>Photos</li>
              <li>Optional profile information such as job, education, height, additional photos, and written responses</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem;">Automatically Collected Information</h3>
            <ul style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              <li>Device and usage information (such as device type, operating system, app interactions)</li>
              <li>A unique internal user identifier</li>
              <li>Log and diagnostic information used for reliability and security</li>
              <li>Approximate location inferred from IP address by analytics and error-reporting tools</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem;">Location Information</h3>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              The App requests access to your device location to support matching and display
              approximate distance and location information to other users. Depending on your
              device settings, you may choose to share either precise or approximate location.
            </p>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              We do not collect location data continuously. Your location is checked when you sign
              up and when you manually update your location in the App.
            </p>

          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">2. Public Profile Information</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              The following information may be visible to other users on your profile:
            </p>
            <ul style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              <li>Name</li>
              <li>Age (derived from date of birth; your date of birth is not shown)</li>
              <li>Gender (as configured by you)</li>
              <li>Photos</li>
              <li>Job (if provided)</li>
              <li>Education (if provided)</li>
              <li>Height (if provided)</li>
              <li>City and state</li>
              <li>Distance (rounded to the nearest mile)</li>
              <li>AI-generated compatibility score and compatibility explanation</li>
            </ul>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              All other information is kept private and is not displayed to other users.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <ul style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              <li>Provide and operate the App</li>
              <li>Create and display user profiles</li>
              <li>Enable messaging between users</li>
              <li>Match users and generate compatibility scores and explanations</li>
              <li>Detect, prevent, and address harmful or prohibited behavior</li>
              <li>Review reports and enforce our community rules</li>
              <li>Improve the App’s functionality, safety, and reliability</li>
              <li>Communicate with you about the App</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">4. AI-Based Matching</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              We use artificial intelligence to analyze profile information, photos, and written
              responses to generate compatibility scores, compatibility explanations, and to
              filter which profiles are shown to users.
            </p>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              These systems are not used for advertising or identity verification, and user data
              processed for matching is not used to train third-party AI models.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">5. Messaging</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              Users may send private messages to matched users. Messages are private by default
              and are not proactively monitored. Messages may be reviewed by our support team
              only if reported by a user.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">6. Safety, Reports, and Moderation</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              Users may report other users through the App. We store report information and
              review reports to take appropriate action, including warnings or bans.
              We may retain limited information related to reports, moderation actions, and
              safety investigations even after an account is deleted where necessary to enforce
              our rules or comply with legal obligations.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">7. Analytics and Error Reporting</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              We use analytics and error-reporting services to understand how the App is used
              and to improve reliability and performance. These services may collect device
              information, usage data, and internal identifiers.
            </p>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              We do not sell personal information or use analytics for advertising. The App
              respects Apple’s App Tracking Transparency framework and does not track users
              across other companies’ apps or websites.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">8. Data Storage and Security</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              We use industry-standard security measures to protect user data, including
              encryption at rest and restricted access to authorized personnel.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">9. Account Deletion</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              You may delete your account at any time through the App or by contacting us.
            </p>
            <ul style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              <li>Profile and account data are deleted immediately</li>
              <li>Photos are deleted</li>
              <li>Authentication data is deleted</li>
              <li>Backup copies may be retained for up to 7 days</li>
            </ul>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              Some information related to reports, analytics, or logs may persist for a limited
              period as described in this policy.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">10. Age Requirement</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              Ocean is intended only for users 18 years of age or older. Accounts found to
              belong to users under 18 will be terminated and deleted.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">11. Sharing of Information</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              We do not sell personal information. We may share information with service
              providers, to comply with legal obligations, or to protect user safety and the
              integrity of the App.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">12. Your Rights</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              You may access, update, or delete your information through the App or by
              contacting us.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">13. Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The effective date will be
              updated when changes are made.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">14. Contact Us</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
              <strong>Crystal Dating, Inc.</strong><br />
              3229 Greenpoint Ave PMB 107<br />
              Long Island City, NY 11101<br />
              United States<br />
              Email: <a href="mailto:support@oceandating.app">support@oceandating.app</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
